<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Lorde returns one year after her diagnosis. Her diagnostic mammogram of the left breast a week ago showed no suspicious findings (BI-RADS 1). She has taken tamoxifen daily for eleven months. Her hot flashes remain mild, one or two a day. Her periods are regular with no bleeding between them. She has no leg swelling, breathlessness, bone pain, cough, headaches, abdominal pain, or new lumps, and no arm swelling. She walks about 30 minutes most days. Her genetic counseling appointment is next week. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Left mammogram BI-RADS 1 a week ago</td></tr><tr><td>Tamoxifen</td><td>Eleven months, taken daily</td></tr><tr><td>Recurrence symptoms</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Gynecologic</td><td>Regular periods; no intermenstrual bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genetic counseling</td><td>Next week</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

